      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "title": "Test the state access boundary",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Remote Terraform state can contain sensitive values. S3 backend access therefore needs permissions for the selected state bucket and object key.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#f1"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb1",
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb2"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Scope approved readers and writers to the required ListBucket prefix and GetObject/PutObject state-object operations. Configure supplied locking permissions separately. Initialize the intended backend and provision the separate exercise bucket through the approved identity. Test that an unapproved identity cannot read or overwrite state, retaining outcomes without exposing state contents.",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#f2",
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb3",
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb4"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "State access isolation prevents unauthorized access; a separate mechanism coordinates concurrent authorized writers. Backend initialization does not prove isolation, and locking is not the authorization boundary. Check unapproved read and overwrite attempts independently of approved provisioning.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#f4"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb3",
              "terraform.state_access_isolation#tb5"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
